% jquiz Parts of the nervous system

% multichoice
text: Which part of the nervous system is made up of the brain and spinal cord?
@answer
text: Central nervous system
correct: true
@answer
text: Peripheral nervous system
correct: false
@answer
text: Cerebrum
correct: false
@answer
text: Cerebellum
correct: false
@answer
text: Brain stem
correct: false
@answer
text: Hypothalamus and pituitary gland
correct: false


